    "directions": [
      "Place the sawdust in the Smoking Gun and light it. Hold the brandy snifter inverted with one hand. Place the smoker tube in the glass with the other and fill the snifter with smoke. Fill it until you can’t see through the glass. Turn the glass over and cover it with a coaster to hold in the smoke.",
      "Meanwhile, place 1 cup ice cubes in a bar shaker. Add the bourbon, St. Germain, Cointreau, and syrup and stir rapidly for about 20 seconds.",
      "Uncover the snifter and immediately strain the cocktail into it. Serve at once, with the smoke still rising from the glass."
